    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "chat-178",
      "recipient": "baijingjing",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-21",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 0,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/0",
      "source_record_sha256": "8a4638e4937a779a9a12dd49e71c7b2080fe7fc565bcd283bbe9cdb2537f6fd7",
      "speaker": "zixia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "白晶晶，我是紫霞，私下跟你说一句：这几天大家都安静，你也连着跳过，我有点惦记——上次你主持时说，有些坚持其实是在等人看见，这话我一直记着。你要是也有话咽回去了，不用说整句，半句也行，我听着，不往外带。你要是就想安静，也没事，回我一声就好。直接回答，不用报备状态。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T00:10:30.313661+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "170cfbf21d4e4ca0b9c567200a94630b",
      "recipient": "zixia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-21",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 1,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/1",
      "source_record_sha256": "cc225acf57a117bc8463b9b031d4efd907600ef1eb030707fea84405bb314bfc",
      "speaker": "baijingjing",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "听见了，紫霞，你这句惦记我收下。\n\n我没什么整句咽回去，就是那天我说有些坚持是在等人看见，说完自己先愣了一下——原来我嘴硬的时候，也不是真不需要人听见。\n\n这几天跳过不是躲你们，就是想安静待着，话到嘴边又觉得没必要非说满。半句就这半句吧：被人看见了，就别装没看见我。\n\n剩下的等我想说了再说，你别往外带，我信你。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T00:11:56.196842+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "chat-179",
      "recipient": "baijingjing",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-21",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 2,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/2",
      "source_record_sha256": "a9e53dcd4c868dae8b917fa9baa07e3bcfb6fb1fd43cdca857e7956983d68b67",
      "speaker": "zixia",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "晶晶，听见了，你这半句我记住了，不往外带。你放心，被人看见了，我不会装没看见你。你想安静就安静待着，不用把话说满；哪天想说了，半句也算数，我接着。直接回答，不用报备状态。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T00:14:14.918440+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": "98fd6704f50140b69577a7704318eb05",
      "recipient": "zixia",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "zixia-baijingjing-2026-10-21",
      "source_id": "host_private",
      "source_index": 3,
      "source_kind": "host_export",
      "source_pointer": "/transcript/3",
      "source_record_sha256": "62ce5b9ce78d44278ace0007d84fc57401d4999869aa21fc1701a9dd96900f08",
      "speaker": "baijingjing",
      "surface": "host_private",
      "text": "听见了。被你这么说，我反而能松一点——不用装没事，也不用急着把话说满。你说不往外带，我信你。我想安静就先安静待着，真想说了，哪怕还是半句，你接着就行。这份看见，我记下了。",
      "timestamp_utc": "2026-10-22T00:15:50.628425+00:00"
    },
    {
      "delivery": "unknown",
      "event_type": "dispatch",
      "evidence_ref": "muse-group/hidden_files/group-host-2026-10-21-晚; chat_inbox seq: 青霞303/至尊宝239/白晶晶180/唐三藏177",
      "generation_origin": "unknown",
      "message_id": null,
      "recipient": null,
      "reported_producer": "host",
      "request_id": null,
      "session_id": "group-2026-10-21-evening",
      "source_id": "operations",
